          another installed package, unconfirmed). Re-evaluate at next base
          image refresh.
        expires: 2026-12-01T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-ALPINE324-EXPAT-19437114:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          Same as SNYK-ALPINE324-EXPAT-19437108 - transitive via base image,
